      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "いやいや、オシュネーさんは立派に優柔不断ですよ。\n僕がいろいろ決めてあげなきゃ\n今日食べるご飯すら決められないじゃないですか。",
      "jp_sha256": "1850af3dd80a5a08babe6151faf74729cd777a49a8ca4e248788646c2f94c124",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아니, 아니, 오슈네 씨는 훌륭하게 우유부단해요.\n제가 이것저것 정해 주지 않으면\n오늘 먹을 밥조차 못 고르잖아요.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 12,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b005-20261106-resume-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "cb643c6a552d1edbe708c2e3abe5ee6d96b3fb9ac06be5520d5d513453108749:000002_1494832344498341493:g0:r11",
      "row_index_0based": 11,
      "serialized_row_index": 11,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "いやいや、オシュネーさんは立派に優柔不断ですよ。\n僕がいろいろ決めてあげなきゃ\n今日食べるご飯すら決められないじゃないですか。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
